# Project: OpenSesh
# File: .gitignore
#
# Keep generated executables, edited MIDI output, and local test output out of
# a source distribution. Recovered Midisoft material is outside this tree and
# is intentionally not covered by this release ignore file.

*.exe
*.mid
*.mod
*.o
*.ose
*.wav
*.zip
*.fbc-*.asm
*.fbc-*.c
music-screen-glyphs.mask
ui-*.bmp
ui-*.png

# Build and test runners recreate these directories from reviewed source.
build/
tests/build/
dist/
.codex-*/

# The local shared GUI tree also contains nonredistributable historical assets.
# Already tracked snapshot files remain tracked. Add new reviewed payloads
# explicitly after updating and verifying SNAPSHOT.sha256.
/vendor/omaGui/**

# Local recordings, compiler output and credentials are not release inputs.
*.sf2
*.log
*.asm
.env
.env.*
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# end of .gitignore
